---
# The desktop test harness and suites are single-threaded host code. The
# concurrency-* checks target the FreeRTOS firmware (ISR/task data sharing) and
# only produce noise here -- e.g. getenv()/isatty() in the colour-tag helper,
# which run once from main() before any thread exists.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -concurrency-*
